  unitName: Merlin (EU)
  unitId: 760164
  unitNumber: 7124
  description: "It all started with a rumor. A legend. A myth. The people of Grand
    Gaia never truly understood what was happening in their world. A shadow. A silhouette.
    An invisible man. Throughout the centuries, many have heard those rumors\u2026
    Reports\u2026 Sightings of an older looking figure standing near places of great
    historical importance. It seems to be a recurring phenomenon, an older man being
    spotted near Emperors as they are preparing to invade hostile lands\u2026 Or
    shadowing behind Tyrants who are looking down on their subjects\u2026 This figure
    has even been seen during the original formation of the Akras Summoners\u2019
    Hall\u2026 Is this really a legend? Or maybe this is much more than that\u2026"
  summonDesc: "I am but a silhouette on our history\u2019s canvas."
  fusionDesc: "Only time will tell\u2026"
